        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\n\r\n*** STUNNING 2 BEDROOM APARTMENT *** IMMACULATE CONDITION THROUGHOUT *** FULLY FURNISHED *** PRIME DUBLIN 8 LOCATION ***\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this exceptional two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally situated in the highly sought-after Newmarket Square development, Wards Hill, Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented apartment is offered in immaculate condition throughout and boasts bright, stylish, and contemporary living accommodation. The accommodation briefly comprises an inviting entrance hallway, spacious open-plan living and dining area, fully fitted modern kitchen, two generously proportioned double bedrooms with ample storage, and a sleek main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property has been meticulously maintained and finished to a high standard, offering comfortable and modern living in one of Dublin's most vibrant and convenient locations.\r\n\r\nNewmarket Square is ideally located in the heart of Dublin 8 and is within walking distance of a host of amenities including cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, gyms, and cultural attractions. The area benefits from excellent public transport links, including numerous bus routes and easy access to the LUAS, while Dublin City Centre is just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features\r\n•2 Bed / 1 Bath\r\n•Fully furnished throughout\r\n•Immaculate condition\r\n•Bright and spacious living accommodation\r\n•Modern fully fitted kitchen\r\n•2 generous double bedrooms\r\n•Highly sought-after Newmarket Square location\r\n•Excellent transport links\r\n•Walking distance to Dublin City Centre\r\n•Close to a wide range of local amenities\r\n•AVAILABLE NOW\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE- FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE - WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
